```python
def ε_closure(Q, δ) -> set:  #
  C, W = set(Q), Q  # as C is updated, a copy of Q is needed
  # invariant: C ∪ ε-closure W δ = ε-closure Q δ
  # variant: ε-closure Q δ - C
  while W != set():
    W = δ̂(δ, W, 'ε') - C
    C |= W
  return fset(C)
```

